{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@740","endTime":299463.182,"result":{"value":"All projects\nWEB EXPERIENCE / 01\nLivSocial.\n\nA social web experience bringing posts, communities, business discovery, and personal connections into one workspace.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nWeb & web apps\nFOCUS\nSocial & community\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\nDevice views\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nA place for conversations to grow.\n\nLivSocial’s desktop artwork presents a central content feed alongside a personal social circle and trending conversations. Navigation separates the home feed, communities, businesses, and profile areas. The result is a view of a social product organized around both people and the content they share.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in LivSocial's original project material.\n\n01\nContent feed\n\nImage posts and written updates sit together in the main reading column.\n\n02\nCommunity navigation\n\nDedicated entry points distinguish communities, businesses, and personal areas.\n\n03\nSocial circle\n\nA side panel brings people and their profiles into view.\n\n04\nTrending conversations\n\nSupporting content helps visitors discover subjects beyond their own feed.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nSocial & community\n\nMustard yellow establishes the product identity, while white content panels keep photo posts and conversations readable. A persistent desktop navigation bar and supporting side columns give the main feed a clear position within a much broader community experience.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside LivSocial.\n\nExplore the original interface screens. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n01\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n02\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n03\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n04\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n05\n05\nRESPONSIVE DESIGN PRESENTATION\nA view across\nthe original devices.\n\nLivSocial's original portfolio composition presents the website on laptop and tablet devices. The artwork below preserves those supplied layouts together, with their original proportions.\n\nThese are source mockups of the project, rather than a new rendering of its live website.\n\nLivSocial / Original device composition\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT WEB PROJECT\nStreamDataX\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nDIGITAL ASSETS & DISCOVERY\nStreamDataX\nCHILDCARE & FAMILY\nLittle Butterflies\nORGANIZATION & COLLABORATION\nTukeeConnect\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
